    {
      "id": "hono",
      "title": "Hono 4.13.16 修复五项安全问题",
      "titleId": "hono-title",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "涉及挂载路径与默认路由器中间件绕过、表单验证遗漏、CSS HTML 注入及 CSRF 检查遗漏。",
          "variant": "dek"
        },
        {
          "text": "使用 Hono 开发 API 应优先评估升级并回归鉴权与表单流程；PreparedRegExpRouter 项目还需重新生成路由数据。",
          "variant": "takeaway"
        }
      ],
      "sourceDate": "2026-11-01",
      "dateLabel": "11 月 1 日发布",
      "eventDate": null,
      "sourcePublishedAt": null,
      "sources": [
        {
          "label": "Hono 发布说明",
          "url": "https://github.com/honojs/hono/releases/tag/v4.13.16",
          "icon": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "llama",
      "title": "llama.cpp 为 OpenCL 加入初步 IQ3 支持",
      "titleId": "llama-title",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "b12031 预发布新增 IQ3_S、IQ3_XXS 量化计算路径，包含 Adreno 实现，对 Snapdragon／Adreno 本地推理开发者更有参考价值。",
          "variant": ""
        },
        {
          "text": "这不是 CUDA 提速更新，实际速度及兼容性仍需按设备验证。",
          "variant": "takeaway"
        }
      ],
      "sourceDate": "2026-11-01",
      "dateLabel": "11 月 1 日 · 预发布",
      "eventDate": null,
      "sourcePublishedAt": null,
      "sources": [
        {
          "label": "llama.cpp 发布说明",
          "url": "https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/releases/tag/b12031",
          "icon": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "qwen",
      "title": "Qwen Code 0.26.5 加强自动修复与验收约束",
      "titleId": "qwen-title",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "PR 验证仅在工作树干净且对应 PR head 时复用目录；产物检查失败或无法运行会标为“结论不确定”。",
          "variant": ""
        },
        {
          "text": "自动修复在三次修复推送后检查仍失败时交给人工，有助于避免无人值守编码反复修改却无法验收。",
          "variant": "takeaway"
        }
      ],
      "sourceDate": "2026-11-01",
      "dateLabel": "11 月 1 日发布",
      "eventDate": null,
      "sourcePublishedAt": null,
      "sources": [
        {
          "label": "Qwen Code 发布说明",
          "url": "https://github.com/QwenLM/qwen-code/releases/tag/v0.26.5",
          "icon": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "linux",
      "title": "Linux 7.2 系列结束上游维护",
      "titleId": "linux-title",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "kernel.org 已将 7.2.15 标为 EOL；同日 7.4-rc1 是候选版，不是稳定版替代。",
          "variant": ""
        },
        {
          "text": "自行维护内核的开发者应规划转向受支持分支；发行版用户仍以发行版自身维护承诺为准。",
          "variant": "takeaway"
        }
      ],
      "sourceDate": "2026-11-01",
      "dateLabel": "11 月 1 日",
      "eventDate": null,
      "sourcePublishedAt": null,
      "sources": [
        {
          "label": "Linux 内核官方发布页",
          "url": "https://www.kernel.org/",
          "icon": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "protostar",
      "title": "ProtoStar 推动公共科研数据复用",
      "titleId": "protostar-title",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "Hugging Face 与高校等伙伴公布计划，改善公开科研数据、模型和代码的可发现性与复用。首场 CMU 气候挑战计划 11 月 2—13 日举行，使用 210 座美国城市数据，将 AI 预测与简单统计基线比较。",
          "variant": ""
        },
        {
          "text": "适合寻找开放数据实践项目的开发者；目前是计划与挑战设计，并非已证明 AI 优于传统方法。",
          "variant": "takeaway"
        }
      ],
      "sourceDate": "2026-10-29",
      "dateLabel": "10 月 29 日公告 · 补充",
      "eventDate": null,
      "sourcePublishedAt": null,
      "sources": [
        {
          "label": "ProtoStar 官方公告",
          "url": "https://huggingface.co/blog/announcing-project-protostar",
          "icon": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "litert",
      "title": "6. LiteRT 升级 Play services GPU 推理",
      "titleId": "litert-title",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "Android 端侧推理通过 CompiledModel API 使用 ML Drift GPU 引擎，运行时由 Play services 共享，不必每个 APK 单独打包。",
          "variant": ""
        },
        {
          "text": "开发者可评估包体及兼容性收益；请求 GPU 和 CPU 时支持 CPU 回退，NPU 支持仍在开发，厂商速度数据不能当本机保证。",
          "variant": "takeaway"
        }
      ],
      "sourceDate": "2026-10-28",
      "dateLabel": "10 月 28 日 · 已发布 · 近 7 日补充",
      "eventDate": null,
      "sourcePublishedAt": null,
      "sources": [
        {
          "label": "Google Developers 官方文章",
          "url": "https://developers.googleblog.com/en/smaller-apps-and-faster-gpu-inference-with-litert-in-google-play-services/",
          "icon": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "openrouter",
      "title": "7. OpenRouter 重构默认路由",
      "titleId": "openrouter-title",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "综合真实价格、延迟、吞吐和错误率选择提供商，不再主要按低输入价格选择。",
          "variant": ""
        },
        {
          "text": "响应可能更快，费用也可能上升；预算敏感者可显式按 price 排序，已有 provider.order 和显式排序仍优先。",
          "variant": "takeaway"
        }
      ],
      "sourceDate": "2026-10-28",
      "dateLabel": "10 月 28 日 · 已上线 · 近 7 日补充",
      "eventDate": null,
      "sourcePublishedAt": null,
      "sources": [
        {
          "label": "OpenRouter 官方公告",
          "url": "https://openrouter.ai/blog/announcements/how-we-rebuilt-provider-routing/",
          "icon": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "macbook",
      "title": "8. 苹果发布触控 OLED MacBook Pro",
      "titleId": "macbook-title",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "新款采用串联 OLED PROLED XDR、M5 Pro／Max，最高 128GB 统一内存，已开放预订，11 月 6 日起交付。",
          "variant": ""
        },
        {
          "text": "桌面开发者需关注触控与键鼠共存，本地 AI 用户仍应等待具体模型、量化与持续推理实测，内存上限不是速度保证。",
          "variant": "takeaway"
        }
      ],
      "sourceDate": "2026-10-28",
      "dateLabel": "10 月 28 日 · 已发布预订 · 近 7 日补充",
