    {
      "id": "ottl",
      "title": "11. OpenTelemetry 转换语言 OTTL 达到 v1",
      "titleId": "ottl-title",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "自 Collector Contrib 0.164.0 起，日志、指标和链路的语法、标准函数及 Go API 获 1.x 向后兼容承诺，降低自托管监控规则升级风险。",
          "variant": ""
        },
        {
          "text": "跨版本升级需清理废弃开关；Lambda、profiles 仍实验性，transform processor 不能一并称稳定。",
          "variant": "takeaway"
        }
      ],
      "sourceDate": "2026-10-27",
      "dateLabel": "10 月 27 日 · 已发布 · 近 7 日补充",
      "eventDate": null,
      "sourcePublishedAt": null,
      "sources": [
        {
          "label": "OpenTelemetry 官方公告",
          "url": "https://opentelemetry.io/blog/2026/ottl-v1/",
          "icon": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "secrets",
      "title": "12. GitHub 按代码上下文拦截潜在密钥",
      "titleId": "secrets-title",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "新 push protection 依据使用上下文补充固定格式匹配，在写入历史前拦截风险。",
          "variant": ""
        },
        {
          "text": "限符合 GHSP／GHAS 条件的组织，默认关闭，启用后消耗 AI 额度；团队评估时须同时考虑覆盖与费用。",
          "variant": "takeaway"
        }
      ],
      "sourceDate": "2026-10-28",
      "dateLabel": "10 月 28 日 · 公共预览 · 近 7 日补充",
      "eventDate": null,
      "sourcePublishedAt": null,
      "sources": [
        {
          "label": "GitHub 官方发布说明",
          "url": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-28-push-protection-beyond-predefined-secret-patterns/",
          "icon": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "obi",
      "title": "13. OpenTelemetry OBI 1.0 发布",
      "titleId": "obi-title",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "Linux 应用可用 eBPF 自动采集指标与链路，降低改源码埋点门槛，新版重点建立配置与升级兼容承诺。",
          "variant": ""
        },
        {
          "text": "适合自托管服务排障，但运行时指标仍实验性，1.0 不代表所有遥测字段稳定。",
          "variant": "takeaway"
        }
      ],
      "sourceDate": "2026-10-30",
